{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012DPiKWGyiBE4ochuyE7q1B","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| mvp_imm_v8c_annealing | Mask ratio annealing (k_ratio 0.9→0.5 线性退火) + gradient isolation (λ=0.5)。渐进引入 pruning 避免 backbone co-adaptation with sudden sparse input，目标 G3-deploy ≤ 1.10 | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- imm_two_stage_v9（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **mvp_imm_v8b_twostage** (failed): Two-stage training: 冻结 baseline_v5 backbone (含 LoRA)，Stage1 (10K) 只训 ACIS selector，Stage2 (20K) 解冻 LoRA 微调。消除 co-adaptation，目标 G3 ≤ 1.10 ← 基于 mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n- **mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1** (negative): gradient isolation + 降低 λ_margin (0.2 vs v8 的 0.5)，减轻 ACIS selection overhead 对 G3 的影响，目标 G3-deploy ≤ 1.10 ← 基于 mvp_imm_anchor_v8\\\\n- **mvp_imm_anchor_v8** (negative): gradient isolation (dual detach) 消除 backbone 权重损伤 (G3a≤1.10)，同时 ACIS 仍能学到有效 importance scoring (G1≥2x, G2≥10pp) ← 基于 mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n  [v8_reeval_fixed_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/artifacts/mvp_imm_anchor_v8/data/v8_reeval_fixed_summary.txt)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 1 / 负向 3 / 失败 11 / 共 16\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-27271: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_baseline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_baseline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_baseline_v3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v4: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_baseline_v4: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v5: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v6: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v7: 训练失败 — unknown\