{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SbZQRvns6rpQtAXHwDtSdL","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 35\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：SmolVLA+LoRA on LIBERO-Object，Baseline vs IMM 对照，验证 Δ_k 提升和 top-k\\\\n    稳定性\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设是 margin maximization 能改善 compression robustness。用最小实验（单 suite、单\\\\n    compression method、两个条件）快速验证因果关系，再决定是否投入完整实验矩阵。CoRL DDL 紧（11天），必须尽快拿到 MVP 信号。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 4 项 warning：ACIS scoring for pruning、Lipschitz 监控、kill path、λ\\\\n    warmup\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出：(1) pruning 应用 ACIS scores 而非 FastV attention 以保证逻辑自洽；(2)\\\\n    certified bound 依赖 L 和 Δ_k 两者，需监控 L·ε/Δ_k ratio；(3) 需定义超参搜索范围和 kill criteria 避免盲目投入；(4)\\\\n    ACIS 依赖 action head 中间表示，训练早期不稳定需 λ warmup。全部合理，纳入 MVP 设计。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: L·ε/Δ_k gate criteria 量化：ratio 下降 ≥30%（相对 baseline）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出其余 3 项 gate criteria 有量化标准但 L·ε/Δ_k 只写\\\\\\\"下降\\\\\\\"，可能出现 Δ_k 涨但 L 同步涨导致\\\\n    ratio 不变的模糊情况。设 ≥30% 下降作为 MVP 粗阈值，足以区分信号。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 增加 k=96 (75% retention) 条件；soft top-k 升级为 implicit differentiation\\\\n    方法\\\\n  rationale: SmolVLA pixel shuffle 后仅 128 tokens total，50% pruning (k=64) 可能过于激进导致\\\\n    false negative。增加 75% retention 对照避免因 pruning ratio 误判核心假设。Soft top-k 原实现不保证 Σp_i=k，梯度有偏，架构报告推荐的\\\\n    implicit differentiation 方法更精确，对 LoRA fine-tuning 稳定性更好。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 数据集从 LIBERO-Object 换为 lerobot 原生可用数据集（候选：aloha_sim_insertion/pusht/xarm_lift）\\\\n  rationale: lerobot/libero_object_no_noops 返回 401 RepositoryNotFoundError，确认不存在。已在数据集问题上浪费多个\\\\n    Worker 和数小时 GPU 空闲时间。MVP 核心假设（margin maximization → top-k stability）不依赖特定数据集，换用\\\\n    lerobot 确认可用的数据集不影响验证。LIBERO 留到 research 阶段通过自定义 dataset adapter 接入。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dry-run 必须同时覆盖 train 和 eval 模式，token_selection.py _hard_forward bug 只在\\\\n    eval 触发\\\\n  rationale: mvp_imm_anchor_v5 在 step 2000 首次 eval 时崩溃：_hard_forward() 中 threshold_low.squeeze(-1)\\\\n    将 (B,1) 变成 (B,) 无法与 (B,N) 广播。此 bug 在 training 模式下不触发（走 _soft_forward），之前所有 dry-run\\\\n    只测了 training step。教训：任何 dry-run 必须同时在 model.train() 和 model.eval() 两种模式下各跑一步。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v5\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: crashed at step 2000 during eval\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Gate Criteria #3 从 \\\\\\\"action_loss 不降 >5%\\\\\\\" 放宽为 \\\\\\\"IMM/baseline 均值比 ≤1.10\\\\\\\"，避免\\\\n    flow matching 噪声误判'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 flow matching loss 稳定在 ~0.01 量级时，5% 相对阈值 = 0.0005 绝对差异，在\\\\n    batch-level 噪声范围内。放宽到 10% 相对阈值，用 eval batches 均值比较，足以检测 IMM 对 action quality 的实质性损害而不被噪声误触。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: loss ~0.001-0.035 at step 9700\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: IMM 训练跳过训练内 eval (eval_every=999999)，用独立 evaluate.py 做全量评估\\\\n  rationale: IMM v6 在 step 2000 eval 再次崩溃，根因是 lerobot 内部 RoPE position embedding 维度不匹配（50\\\\n    vs 82），非我们代码 bug。修复 lerobot 内部代码耗时且脆弱，而独立 evaluate.py 已修复验证通过。跳过训练内 eval 可立即重启，通过\\\\n    train_loss + gradient + margin_loss 监控训练健康。save_every 从 5000 改为 2000 作为 fallback。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v6\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: crashed at step 2000 during eval - lerobot RoPE bug\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: _hard_forward 改为 binary mask 保持序列长度（方案 C），不物理删除 tokens，避免 prefix 长度不匹配\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 定位 v6 crash 真因：_hard_forward 返回 (B, k, D) 但 tokens_per_cam 仍为\\\\n    [64]，_build_prefix_with_vis_tokens 构建的 embs/pad 长度不一致导致 RoPE position_ids 82 vs\\\\n    query 50。方案 C 最安全：eval 模式用 binary 0/1 mask 乘以 tokens，输出 (B, N, D) 与 _soft_forward\\\\n    一致，不改变序列结构，兼容所有下游长度假设。merge 逻辑暂时去掉（post-MVP 恢复为保持序列长度的版本）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v6\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: crashed at step 2000 - prefix length mismatch from _hard_forward physical\\\\n      token removal\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Gate Criteria comparison protocol: Gates #1/#2/#4 用 IMM step_002000 checkpoint\\\\n    作参照（ACIS 几乎未训练），Gate #3 用 baseline_v5 final action_loss；L 值用 L_empirical'\\\\n  rationale: 'Baseline 无 ACIS 模块，无法直接计算 Δ_k/preservation/ratio。IMM step_002000 是最早可用\\\\n    checkpoint，且 lambda warmup 期间 margin_loss 权重极低，ACIS 几乎未被有效训练，可作为\\\\\\\"训练前\\\\\\\"参照。Gate #3\\\\n    直接用 baseline_v5 clean_loss=0.00422。Gate #4 的 L 值用 L_empirical（power iteration,\\\\n    0.096）作为主要指标，L_spectral（1.067）作为保守上界在报告中标注——spectral norm 包含了不影响 visual token\\\\n    scoring 的层（query_proj/q_proj），过于保守。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: treatment\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D011: evaluate.py baseline 路径必须修复——扰动/剪枝未实际应用'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: evaluate.py 在 imm_enabled=False 时跳过 perturb_images()\\\\n    和 pruning，baseline_v5 的 eps>0 / prune=True 结果全部无效（仅反映 flow matching 随机采样方差）。证据：eps=0.02\\\\n    loss < eps=0.0 loss，违反单调性。修复前仅 eps0.0_pruneFalse (0.00422) 可引用。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: eps>0 和 prune=True 结果无效\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Gate D003 的 l_eps_delta_ratio 改用 median（非 mean），mean 被 tail 极端值严重扭曲\\\\n  rationale: Step 4000 eval 显示 ratio mean 从 1.218→1.762 恶化，但 median 从 0.193→0.165\\\\n    实际改善。mean 被极端 token 拉偏（eps0.05+prune 条件下 mean=33.62 vs median 远低于此）。Median 更能反映\\\\n    typical token 的鲁棒性改善，用于 gate 判定更合理。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'step 4000: ratio_mean 1.762 (恶化) vs ratio_median 0.165 (改善)'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7 Lipschitz 爆炸：不 kill 但设 step 8000 kill 条件；cuda:0 立即启动 v7.1 (lambda=0.2,\\\\n    grad_clip=30)\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 报告 v7 step 6000 的 lipschitz_empirical 从 0.096 指数增长到 0.606，Gate\\\\n    D003 的 L·ε/Δ_k ratio 上升 221% 而非下降 30%。根因: lambda_margin=0.5 太激进。决策: (1) v7 继续到\\\\n    step 8000 收集数据但设 kill 条件 (L>1.0 / grad>100 / median ratio>1.0)；(2) cuda:0 空闲违反资源纪律，立即启动\\\\n    v7.1 用更保守超参 (lambda=0.2, grad_clip=30) 并行探索。这符合 kill path 协议的超参搜索流程。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: 触发\\\\n    result: Lipschitz 爆炸, D003 完全失败\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_1\\\\n    role: 修正实验\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill v7.1 (eval mode leak bug)，修复 metrics.py 后重启为 v7.2 (同配置)\\\\n  rationale: v7.1 的 LIP_MONITOR 代码调用 acis.eval() 未恢复 train mode，导致 spectral norm power\\\\n    iteration 停止，SN 从 1.014 飙到 4.617。step 500 起训练数据无效。修复是一行代码（恢复 training mode），v7.2\\\\n    用修复后的代码重启，配置不变。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_1\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: eval mode leak 导致 spectral norm 失控\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: 修正重启\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: G4 改为 IMM LED 绝对阈值（median < 1.0），不再与 baseline 做 relative comparison\\\\n  rationale: Baseline 无 ACIS 机制，Lipschitz 常数 L=0，LED ratio=0，relative decrease 无意义。Reviewer\\\\n    建议 (b) 方案：改为绝对阈值。LED = L·ε·k/Δ_k < 1.0 意味着 certified bound 成立（扰动不超过 margin），这是\\\\n    IMM 的核心理论目标。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: eval_target\\\\n    result: running_eval\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: L=0 无法比较\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7 MVP Gate FAIL (G3=3.28x)；不修订 G3 定义；v7.2 为决定性实验；pruning 鲁棒性数据留作论文素材\\\\n  rationale: v7 (lambda=0.5) G1/G2/G4 大幅通过但 G3 严重失败 (3.28x vs ≤1.10)。Reviewer 建议增加\\\\n    G3b (pruned scenario gate)，拒绝——mid-evaluation 修改 gate 定义会损害 MVP 评估的诚信度。clean performance\\\\n    是合理的硬约束：一个主任务退化 3.28x 的模型即使 pruning 鲁棒也不可接受。但 Reviewer 揭示的 pruning 数据极有价值：(1)\\\\n    IMM prune50% 仅增 8% loss vs baseline 增 2816%；(2) baseline 训练越久 pruning 越脆弱 (4.4x→9.7x→29.2x)。这些作为论文素材保留。v7.2\\\\n    (lambda=0.2) step 20K action_loss=0.0028 强烈暗示 G3 可通过，等其完成做最终判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: G3=3.28x FAIL, G1/G2/G4 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_baseline_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: clean=0.00408, prune50%=0.1190\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: deciding\\\\n    result: running, step 20K action_loss=0.0028\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 21:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7 Gate FAIL (G3=3.28x)。G3 标准不改——clean 性能退化是真实问题。v7.2 (lambda=0.2) 为决定性实验，step\\\\n    20K action_loss=0.0028 低于 baseline，有望 PASS\\\\n  rationale: v7 (lambda=0.5) G1/G2/G4 大幅 PASS（margin 55x, preservation +44pp, LED\\\\n    0.27），但 G3 clean action_loss 3.28x baseline，远超 1.10 阈值。Reviewer 建议增加 G3b（pruned\\\\n    条件），但 G3b 是 post-hoc 修改——clean 性能 3.28x 退化意味着不 prune 时模型严重变差，这是方法的真实缺陷而非评估缺陷。pruning\\\\n    场景优势（IMM 8.2x better）记录为论文素材但不改 Gate。v7.2 step 20K action_loss=0.0028 < baseline\\\\n    0.00408，G3 ratio 若维持约 0.69，可 PASS。等 v7.2 完成做最终 MVP 判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: failed_gate\\\\n    result: G3=3.28x FAIL, G1/G2/G4 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: rescue\\\\n    result: step 20K action_loss=0.0028, pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: v7.2 mid-checkpoint G3=8.1x 确认两个 lambda (0.2/0.5) 均大幅失败；train/eval\\\\n    discrepancy 为关键诊断点——决定 MVP 走向'\\\\n  rationale: v7 (lambda=0.5) final G3=3.28x，v7.2 (lambda=0.2) step 20K G3=8.1x（50-batch\\\\n    eval）。D16/D17 的乐观基于训练 loss 0.0028，但 eval loss 0.033——10x discrepancy。Agent 正在诊断此\\\\n    discrepancy。两条路径：(1) 若 eval 有 bug → 修复后 G3 可能 OK；(2) 若 real behavior → 两个 lambda\\\\n    均失败证明非调参问题，需架构级修复（gradient isolation / stop-gradient on ACIS→action pathway）。v7.2\\\\n    步数 29900/30000 即将完成，等 500-batch final eval + 诊断结果后做最终 MVP 判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: failed_gate\\\\n    result: G3=3.28x\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: mid_eval\\\\n    result: G3=8.1x at step 20K (50-batch)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: G3 拆分为三层指标：G3a (bypass-ACIS, 权重损伤) 为 MVP gate，G3b (soft) 和 G3c (hard) 为论文指标\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer CRITICAL 指出 Agent 将 eval 改为 train mode 从根本上改变了 G3 含义。原始 G3 (eval\\\\n    mode hard selection) 混合了两个独立现象：(1) IMM 训练是否损伤模型权重，(2) hard token selection 的信息损失代价。MVP\\\\n    核心假设是\\\\\\\"IMM 训练能否在不破坏模型的前提下增大 margin\\\\\\\"——对应的是现象 (1)，不是 (2)。bypass-ACIS eval（跳过 selector，全\\\\n    token 前传）是最干净的权重损伤测试。hard selection 代价是部署工程问题（可调 k_ratio / 推理时用 soft selection），不应阻断\\\\n    MVP 验证。三层定义：G3a = bypass-ACIS ratio ≤ 1.10（MVP gate）；G3b = soft-mode ratio（论文）；G3c\\\\n    = hard-mode ratio（论文部署分析）。所有三个数字必须在论文中如实报告。这不是降低标准——是测量正确的东西。D016/D017 拒绝改标准是对的（3.28x\\\\n    hard mode 确实不可接受），但问题是 hard mode 同时测了两件事。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: G3_hard=3.28x, G3_bypass待测\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: G3_hard=8.1x→2.65x(fix), G3_soft/bypass待测\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D017\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D019: G3 双轨定义——G3-hard (eval mode, 部署) 为主指标，G3-soft (train mode, 权重损伤)\\\\n    为诊断辅助；当前两者均 FAIL 确认架构级问题'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 Agent 将 evaluate.py 的 action_loss 从 eval mode (hard binary\\\\n    mask) 改为 train mode (soft selection)，从根本上改变了 G3 含义。裁决：G3-hard (eval mode) 保持为\\\\n    MVP primary gate——这是部署时真实性能，且与之前所有 eval 一致可比。G3-soft (train mode) 作为诊断指标报告——区分\\\\\\\"权重损伤\\\\\\\"和\\\\\\\"hard\\\\n    selection 代价\\\\\\\"。关键发现：v7.2 step 20K G3-soft=2.65x 仍远超 1.10x，说明不仅是 hard→soft 问题，模型权重确实被\\\\n    margin_loss 梯度损伤。这进一步确认需要 v8 gradient isolation。当前 v7.2 final eval (PID 75008,\\\\n    old code, eval mode) 继续运行——其结果作为 G3-hard 有效。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2\\\\n    role: eval_in_progress\\\\n    result: G3-soft=2.65x at step 20K (50-batch), G3-hard pending (500-batch final)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: v7+v7.2 MVP FAIL (G3a=1.91x 确认权重损伤)；核心假设部分验证；v8 gradient isolation 为最终\\\\n    MVP 验证\\\\n  rationale: v7.2 final 500-batch 结果：G1=64.3x✅ G2=+47.5pp\\\\n\\\\n... [截断: 省略 10743 字符，传 max_chars=0 获取完整内容]\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 22743, \\\"truncated\\\": true}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QjDroLaKHUxdDKfWJLx5PN","session_id":"bb1204a1-c392-4e41-ba2c-f9f3353a30d7","uuid":"f80f0be4-66da-4035-a9e0-24bb355163ac","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:27:53.483Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01B6CY4v2WEfyC4nAh4jZmA9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VzyPWm62SXALVvDbKDq9BK","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R2: Novelty + Related Work Review","prompt":"You are Reviewer 2 (R2) for a CoRL 2026 submission. Your focus: **Novelty and Related Work**. Perform a thorough, independent review. Do NOT consult any external resources — all information you need is below.\n\n## CoRL Review Criteria\n- Rating scale 1-10 (10=top 5% seminal, 9=strong accept top 15%, 8=clear accept top 50%, 7=accept, 6=marginally above threshold, 5=marginally below, 4=reject, 3=clear reject, 2=strong reject, 1=trivial/wrong)\n- Dimensions: Originality, Quality, Clarity, Significance, Relevance, Limitations\n- CoRL acceptance rate: ~30-35%. CoRL requires relevance to robot learning.\n\n## Paper: \"Importance Margin Maximization: Certified Robust and Lossless Token Compression for Vision-Language-Action Models\"\n\n### Abstract\nVLA models need aggressive token compression for real-time deployment, but compressed representations are brittle under adversarial perturbations. Root cause: importance margin collapse — the gap Δ_k between retained/pruned token scores is too small. Propose IMM training framework that maximizes Δ_k, yielding first certified robustness guarantee for VLA token compression: P(top-k changes) ≤ k·ε·L/Δ_k. Two-stage training (freeze backbone→train ACIS; freeze ACIS→LoRA backbone) eliminates co-adaptation and enables lossless 50% compression that improves performance via denoising. On LIBERO, SmolVLA achieves 76.0% clean SR (+4.7pp over baseline) and 62% under combined 7-dim perturbation vs 35% undefended. Cross-model on OpenVLA (7B). Compression-agnostic: +51pp preservation on FastV/VLA-IAP/VLA-Cache. ACIS adds 0.9% params, -36.5% latency, -42% memory.\n\n### Related Work (Section 2)\n**VLA Token Compression:** FastV (attention-based pruning), VLA-IAP (importance-aware pruning policy), VLA-Cache (caching/reusing tokens across timesteps), LightVLA and GridS (spatial downsampling). All focus on efficiency–quality trade-off, none provide robustness analysis.\n\n**Adversarial Robustness for VLAs:** Less Is More [1] (arXiv:2601.12042, 2025) — shows VLA compression is adversarially vulnerable, proposes adversarial training with \"only limited protection.\" CAGE [2] (ICML 2026) — formalizes attack surface of token compression but offers no defense. RobustVLA — Jacobian regularization for full model, not compression boundary. ProGAL-VLA — randomized smoothing for certified action robustness, not token selection.\n\n**Certified Robustness:** Randomized smoothing for ℓ2 classifiers. Interval bound propagation for neural networks. Paper claims first certified stability guarantee specifically for top-k selection in token compression.\n\n**Only 2 formal references** cited in the paper ([1] and [2]).\n\n### Method (Section 3)\n- **Core Insight**: Importance margin collapse (small Δ_k) makes top-k selection unstable under perturbations.\n- **Certified Bound**: P(top-k changes) ≤ k·ε·L/Δ_k for L-Lipschitz scorer with perturbation ‖δ‖ ≤ ε.\n- **IMM Loss**: L_IMM = L_action + λ·L_margin, where L_margin = max(0, γ - Δ_k) hinge loss with adaptive γ.\n- **Two-Stage Training**: Stage 1 freeze backbone → train ACIS; Stage 2 freeze ACIS → LoRA backbone. Eliminates co-adaptation.\n- **ACIS**: Cross-attention head + 2-layer MLP. 2.3M parameters.\n\n### Key Claims\n1. First certified robustness bound for VLA token compression (empirically tight at 1.51×)\n2. Two-stage protocol enables lossless compression (G3 < 1.0) with denoising effect\n3. Mechanistic explanation: pruned tokens are background noise (83% background, 0.25× attention, 0.14× gradient)\n\n### Results Summary\n- aloha_sim_insertion: 88% vs 82% baseline (+6pp, p=0.031)\n- LIBERO 3 suites: +4.7pp average, all G3 < 1.0\n- OpenVLA 7B validation: +3.7pp, all G3 < 1.0\n- Defense comparison: IMM Pareto-dominant (76% clean, 71% perturbed vs AT 68/63, RS 70/61, JR 72/65)\n- Cross-compression: +48-52pp preservation on FastV/VLA-IAP/VLA-Cache\n- ACIS overhead: +0.9% params, -36.5% latency, -42% memory\n\n### Limitations Stated\nSpectral-norm Lipschitz loosens at large ε (>0.05). Physics perturbations weakest point. Temporal token selection is future work.\n\n## Your Task\nProvide a thorough review focusing on:\n1. **Novelty assessment**: How novel is the core idea (margin maximization for token compression stability)? How does it relate to margin-based methods in other domains (SVM, contrastive learning, adversarial training)?\n2. **Related work completeness**: Are key related works missing? Is the positioning fair? Is the \"first certified robustness for token compression\" claim valid?\n3. **Claim validity**: Are the three core claims well-supported? Any overclaiming?\n4. **Broader impact**: Does this advance the field meaningfully?\n5. **Reference concerns**: Only 2 references are cited — is this a major issue?\n\n## Output Format\n```\n### R2 Review: Novelty and Related Work\n\n**Summary** (3-4 sentences)\n\n**Strengths**\n- S1: ...\n- S2: ...\n- ...\n\n**Weaknesses**\n- W1: ...\n- W2: ...\n- ...\n\n**Questions for Authors**\n- Q1: ...\n- ...\n\n**Missing Related Work**\n- ...\n\n**Minor Issues**\n- ...\n\n**Scores**\n- Originality: X/10\n- Quality: X/10\n- Clarity: X/10\n- Significance: X/10\n- Relevance: X/10\n- Overall: X/10\n- Confidence: X/5\n\n**Overall Assessment** (2-3 sentences)\n```\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1723,"cache_read_input_tokens":58463,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1723},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb1204a1-c392-4e41-ba2c-f9f3353a30d7","uuid":"58f6f16e-1c7f-4e9e-968c-335b2a1710da"}
