{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BpVefmvR72Jp53xPfKNtH7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# importance_margin_vla_compress — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 07:54 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer warning 修正：补 multi-seed 要求，修正 P0 count 和 GPU 预算\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nImportance Margin Maximization (IMM)：直接最大化 VLA visual token 的 importance margin Δ_k，使 token compression 在对抗扰动下具有可证明的 top-k 选择稳定性。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 已通过，2026-05-16）\\\\n- **基础设施**: westd-27271, 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB\\\\n- **MVP 结果**: G1=93.23x ✅ | G2=+56pp ✅ | G3=0.87x ✅ | G4=0.135 ✅\\\\n- **核心方案**: Two-stage training（Stage1 冻结 backbone 训 ACIS → Stage2 冻结 ACIS 训 LoRA）\\\\n- **Paper framing**: 已写，3 条 Core Claims（provable robustness / lossless-to-gainful compression / denoising effect）\\\\n- **Experiment plan**: 已写，12 个实验（P0: 7 个 ~242 GPU-hrs / P1: 5 个 ~58 GPU-hrs），含 multi-seed\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260516T075046 running，full review mode，等回调\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 回调 → 根据审稿反馈调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] success rate 评估（plan_001）— sim 环境准备中，cuda:1\\\\n- [ ] v8c_annealing 完成 → 评估（plan_010）— cuda:0\\\\n- [ ] Dream 达标后批准 P0 实验启动\\\\n- [ ] 向 Manager 申请加卡（P0 总量 ~242 GPU-hrs，CoRL 13 天 DDL 需至少 4 张卡）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nwestd-27271: 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB。\\\\n- **cuda:0**: v8c_annealing 运行中\\\\n- **cuda:1**: success rate 评估准备中\\\\n- **P0 实验总预算**: ~242 GPU-hrs（含 3-seed 重复）\\\\n- **P1 实验总预算**: ~58 GPU-hrs\\\\n- **需要加卡**：CoRL DDL 前需至少 4 张卡并行\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿时间线\\\\n| Venue | Deadline | 距今 | 可行性 |\\\\n|-------|----------|------|--------|\\\\n| CoRL 2026 | May 29 paper | 13 天 | 极紧，需 4+ 卡并行 + 无失败重跑 |\\\\n| AAAI 2027 | ~Aug 2026 | ~3 月 | 充裕 |\\\\n| ICLR 2027 | ~Oct 2026 | ~5 月 | 全面扩展 |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-16 | v8b_twostage MVP 全 Gate PASS: G1=93.23x, G2=+56pp, | mvp_imm_v8b_twostage, mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1 |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-16 | v8.1 (λ=0.2) NEGATIVE: G3=2.53x，降低 λ 反而恶化。根因是低 λ → | mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1, mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_imm_v8b_twostage |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-16 | D032: two-stage 简化为 ACIS-only (30K steps, backbone | mvp_imm_v8b_twostage |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-16 | D031: 不等 v8.1 结果，立即在 cuda:1 启动 two-stage 训练与 v8.1  | mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1, mvp_imm_v8b_twostage |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-16 | D030: Two-stage 确定为 v8.1 FAIL 后首选方向；提前准备代码+dry-run | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1 |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-16 | D029: v8 re-eval (fixed) G3=1.344x FAIL 确认；bypass  | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_baseline_v5, mvp_imm_anchor_v8_1 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-16 | D028 eval bug 确认：evaluate.py 三处 bug 导致所有 pruning 数 | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_baseline_v5 |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-16 | D026 失效：500-batch pruneTrue/baseline=1.456x 推翻 100 | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_baseline_v5 |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-16 | G3 gate 最终定义：主 gate 改为 G3-deploy (PruneTrue/baseli | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_baseline_v5, mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2 |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-16 | G3 gate 重定义：主 gate 改为 G3-deploy (ACIS+Prune/baseli | mvp_imm_anchor_v8, mvp_imm_anchor_v7_2 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2768, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016UG8zNt2hDaaYdinwCYqYq","session_id":"bb1204a1-c392-4e41-ba2c-f9f3353a30d7","uuid":"07445346-bbd4-4233-9807-fe7dd8531bb5","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:30:26.528Z"}
